NAME

  devc-cpuid - Driver for /dev/cpu/N/cpuid

SYNOPSYS

  devc-cpuid [-U uid] [-G gid] [-P perms]

DESCRIPTION

  This resource manager implements Linux API compatible devices similar to the
  cpuid.ko module.

OPTIONS

  -U  The user id (name or integer)
  -G  The group id (name or integer)
  -P  Permissions for the device node (masked 0777)
